[12.547251, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[12.547298, "o", "3. **Extract and Rename Fields**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[12.547311, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[12.547368, "o", "   - Extract '\"'\"'id'\"'\"' as '\"'\"'user_id'\"'\"'.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[12.547387, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[12.547424, "o", "   - Extract '\"'\"'username'\"'\"'.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[12.54743, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[12.547434, "o", "> "]
[12.547535, "o", "   - Extract '\"'\"'email'\"'\"'.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[12.5476, "o", "   - Extract and format '\"'\"'last_login'\"'\"'.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[12.547647, "o", "   - Extract the count of roles as '\"'\"'role_count'\"'\"'.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[12.547818, "o", "   - Extract the first role from the '\"'\"'roles'\"'\"' array as '\"'\"'primary_role'\"'\"' (if roles exist, otherwise null).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[12.547853, "o", "> "]
[12.547982, "o", "4. **Sort Users**: Sort the resulting users alphabetically by their '\"'\"'username'\"'\"' in ascending order.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[12.548139, "o", "5. **Output Format**: The output must be a JSON array of objects formatted with indentation of 2 spaces.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[12.548419, "o", "6. **Save Command**: Save the exact jq command you execute to a file named '\"'\"'/app/cmd.sh'\"'\"'. This file should contain the complete jq command used to generate the output, including all options and arguments.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[12.548465, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[12.548651, "o", "7. **Save Arguments**: Save all jq arguments(excluding input/output files) to a YAML file named '\"'\"'/app/jq_args.yaml'\"'\"'. This file should contain exactly two keys:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[12.548719, "o", "   - '\"'\"'filter'\"'\"': A string containing the jq filter expression\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[12.548746, "o", "> "]
