[12.550687, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[12.550949, "o", "**Note on examples below**: In the following Data Schema sections, all content following the '\"'\"'#'\"'\"' symbol is just explanatory commentary and will NOT appear in the actual JSON files. These comments are only provided to clarify the structure and requirements.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> **Input Data Schema**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[12.550999, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
